	"data": "Vault Vocabulary — JSON-LD Predicate Mapping\n\nThe formal RDF vocabulary for the Obsidian vault knowledge graph. Maps the 9 predicates extracted from vault prose to standard RDF vocabularies where they fit, and defines custom vault: predicates where no standard applies.\n\nThis is Phase 2 of the ThoughtBubbles data model. The @context lives at vault/vault-context.jsonld and can be imported by any JSON-LD file in the vault.\n\nNamespace\n\nAll custom predicates use this namespace. Standard prefixes…",
